{"text": "GREYSTONE FAMILY DENTISTRY\n612 N. Pearl St., Ellensburg, WA 98926   ph 509-555-0141   frontdesk@greystonefamilydental.example\n\nTREATMENT PLAN & FINANCIAL ARRANGEMENT                      printed 01/22/2026\n\nPatient:  Lindahl, Henrik     Chart # GF-11873     DOB 05/17/1957\nResponsible party:  Annika Lindahl (spouse)     40 Thorp Prairie Rd, Thorp, WA 98946\nHome 509-555-0178   her cell 509 555 0123   annika.lindahl@mailhaven.example\nDentist:  Mi-rae Cheung, DDS (WA lic. DE60417733)     Treatment coordinator: Jocelyn\n\nMedical alerts: type 2 diabetes, last A1c 8.1; on warfarin, INR needed within 72 hrs of any extraction;\npenicillin allergy. Cleared with his physician by phone 1/20.\nFindings: generalized moderate periodontitis, fractured cusp #19, irreversible pulpitis #30,\nnight-time grinding. Third molar #1 non-restorable.\n\n Visit  Tooth  Code    Procedure                      Fee        Plan pays   Patient\n 1      UR/LR  D4341   Scaling & root planing x2      $548.00    $438.40     $109.60\n 2      #30    D3330   Root canal, molar            $1,385.00    $692.50     $692.50\n 3      #30    D2740   Crown, porcelain/ceramic     $1,490.00    $369.10   $1,120.90\n 3      #19    D2740   Crown, porcelain/ceramic     $1,490.00        $0.00   $1,490.00\n 4      #1     D7140   Extraction                     $245.00        $0.00     $245.00\n                                             TOTAL  $5,158.00  $1,500.00   $3,658.00\n\nInsurance: Sterling Dental Benefit Plan, subscriber Annika Lindahl through her employer, member ID SDB 300 771 42, group WA-06611.\nAnnual maximum $1,500; $0 used so far in 2026. The plan estimate is not a guarantee. Pre-determination sent 1/21/26, ref PD-4471902.\n\nPAYMENT ARRANGEMENT (no interest, so the Truth in Lending Act disclosures do not apply; we do not take CareCredit)\n - Down payment today: $658.00 on card.\n - Balance $3,000.00 in six payments of $500.00 on the 5th of each month, March 5 through August 5, 2026.\n - Card on file (Visa), holder ANNIKA LINDAHL:  4540-0156-7938-9160   exp 11/27   CVV 608\n   Mrs. Lindahl gave the card by phone; Henrik is not an authorized user.\n - Backup if the card declines: bank draft from Kittitas Farmers Bank, routing 059828822, checking 81 0044 6217.\n - A missed payment adds $25 and pauses lab work on the crowns.\n\nPatient/responsible party signature: A. Lindahl          Date: 1-22-26\nStaff: J. Ramos   (note: Mr. Lindahl asked that statements NOT go to the Thorp address; the couple are in the middle of a divorce. Email Annika only.)", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "333 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Henrik Lindahl", "Annika Lindahl", "Mi-rae Cheung"], "companies": ["GREYSTONE FAMILY DENTISTRY", "Sterling Dental Benefit Plan", "Kittitas Farmers Bank"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999925494194, "modelMs": 17494.5, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 26, "text": "GREYSTONE FAMILY DENTISTRY", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "GREYSTONE FAMILY DENTISTRY"}, {"start": 27, "end": 43, "text": "612 N. Pearl St.", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "612 N. Pearl St."}, {"start": 45, "end": 59, "text": "Ellensburg, WA", "kind": "places", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Ellensburg, WA"}, {"start": 60, "end": 65, "text": "98926", "kind": "zip", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "98926"}, {"start": 71, "end": 83, "text": "509-555-0141", "kind": "phone", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "509-555-0141"}, {"start": 86, "end": 125, "text": "frontdesk@greystonefamilydental.example", "kind": "email", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "frontdesk@greystonefamilydental.example"}, {"start": 137, "end": 165, "text": 